Q("The hire-ready myth believes:", ["Training matters", "The market sells ready-made people and the firm's job is shopping — when it sells raw material and the conversion is the firm's job", "Hiring is hard", "Curricula work"], 1, "Hiring buys potential; training converts it.", "Ch1"),
