Q("The skill map is:", ["A wish list", "Per role, the required competences at levels — the reference grid for gaps, syllabi, and succession", "The org chart", "A survey"], 1, "Built with managers, maintained as roles evolve, governed as a master.", "Ch2"),
Q("Error clusters in the operational reads are:", ["Disciplinary matters", "Needs wearing incident clothes — the refresher flag before the disciplinary question", "Random", "Ignored"], 1, "The academy's quiet gift to this module.", "Ch2"),
